<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - British Air cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - British Air cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it cut its near-term rating on British Airways Plc to neutral from accumulate and its long-term rating to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Clive Anderson was not immediately available for comment.</p>
